[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0498","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0498.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-15683","title":"Lorex 2K Indoor Wi-Fi Security Camera 设备管理服务器证书验证不当漏洞","description":"Lorex 2K Indoor Wi-Fi Security Camera 设备管理服务器存在证书验证不当漏洞（CWE-295）。该漏洞源于设备管理功能未能正确验证服务器提供的证书，导致网络相邻的攻击者可在无需用户交互的情况下，利用中间人攻击等手段绕过证书校验，结合其他漏洞在 root 权限上下文中执行任意代码。受影响产品为 Lorex 2K Indoor Wi-Fi Security Camera 系列，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。厂商已发布固件更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-15683"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-07-13T22:16:45Z","updated":"2026-07-14T16:45:45Z","remediation":"厂商尚未发布官方固件更新。建议立即采取以下缓解措施：(1) 在路由器/交换机上为摄像头设备启用 802.1X 端口认证，限制仅授权设备可接入局域网；(2) 在防火墙上设置 ACL 规则，禁止摄像头与除 NVR/管理端外的其他内网设备通信；(3) 将摄像头固件升级至厂商后续发布的最新版本（关注 https://www.lorex.com/support）；(4) 如非必要，将摄像头隔离在独立 VLAN 中，避免与核心业务网络直连。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-26-399/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2026/15xxx/CVE-2026-15683.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/e6fb55bfbbe31c8b8776d60f6e3b3154ee0fa3bf/reports/2026-07-13/TIER_3_CVE-2026-15683.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/13cb9776e1a75871fdb2907e6c4ccac1909e538b/2026/15xxx/CVE-2026-15683.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-15683.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-15683.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-4hrf-7rvp-8x6g/GHSA-4hrf-7rvp-8x6g.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db2f5eda64b048f89c93b57f05c779b62a05c5c9/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-15683.json","https://github.com/wooluo/vuln_crawler/blob/32f2293479ff686679659fbb5e0a89dfb65ba641/vulnerability_reports/vulnerability_report_2026-07-16_11-05-13.md","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/eb9d5949573bf98755141185e45226827196e91c/vulndb/vulns/nist/2026/07/VW-2026-22270.yaml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/a7af5a678b55af1e4884963bdb9ea6fae03d5b34/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-156xx/CVE-2026-15683.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0498.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0497","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0497.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-15682","title":"AnyDesk 支持信息发送功能链接跟随拒绝服务漏洞","description":"AnyDesk 的\"发送支持信息\"功能存在链接跟随漏洞（CWE-59）。本地攻击者首先需在目标系统上获得低权限代码执行能力，随后通过创建目录交接点（junction）滥用该服务创建任意文件，最终可导致系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 AnyDesk 远程桌面软件，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。攻击者需具备本地访问权限，无法远程利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-15682"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-07-13T22:16:45Z","updated":"2026-07-14T20:59:52Z","remediation":"升级 AnyDesk 至 9.0.4 以上版本（如厂商后续发布安全更新）。若无法升级，限制低权限用户对 AnyDesk 的访问，通过组策略或 AppLocker 禁止非管理员运行 AnyDesk，并监控 %TEMP% 和 %PROGRAMDATA% 目录下的异常符号链接创建行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-26-401/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2026/15xxx/CVE-2026-15682.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/13cb9776e1a75871fdb2907e6c4ccac1909e538b/2026/15xxx/CVE-2026-15682.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-15682.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-15682.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-f5mf-mx82-hm83/GHSA-f5mf-mx82-hm83.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db2f5eda64b048f89c93b57f05c779b62a05c5c9/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-15682.json","https://github.com/ugurkocde/IntuneBrew/blob/3e7c2fe112eccba69af54d09cdf7821b2b156394/CVE/anydesk.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/eb9d5949573bf98755141185e45226827196e91c/vulndb/vulns/nist/2026/07/VW-2026-22269.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-15682.json","https://github.com/LeSuisse/nixpkgs-security-advisory-osv/blob/723cc8b27c32d0b04c91d92b588359c853c89df5/advisories/2026/NIXPKGS-2026-2168.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0497.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0494","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0494.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-15681","title":"AnyDesk 屏幕录制链接追踪拒绝服务漏洞","description":"AnyDesk 屏幕录制文件处理存在链接跟随漏洞（CWE-59），攻击者需先在目标系统上获得低权限代码执行能力，随后通过创建目录 junction 符号链接，利用 AnyDesk 服务在处理屏幕录制文件时对文件路径的验证不足，诱导服务在任意位置创建文件，最终导致系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 AnyDesk 多个版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-15681"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-07-13T22:16:45Z","updated":"2026-07-14T21:00:36Z","remediation":"升级至 AnyDesk 9.7.10 或更高版本（该版本已修复安全漏洞），可通过 AnyDesk 官网下载最新版或使用内置更新功能。由于该漏洞需要攻击者先在目标系统上获得低权限代码执行能力，建议同时限制非授权用户的本地登录权限，并通过组策略或 ACL 控制 AnyDesk 的屏幕录制功能访问。如无法立即升级，可暂时禁用 AnyDesk 的屏幕录制功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-26-400/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2026/15xxx/CVE-2026-15681.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2026/15xxx/CVE-2026-15681.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-15681.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-15681.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-fxcj-7h34-wrrr/GHSA-fxcj-7h34-wrrr.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db2f5eda64b048f89c93b57f05c779b62a05c5c9/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-15681.json","https://github.com/ugurkocde/IntuneBrew/blob/3e7c2fe112eccba69af54d09cdf7821b2b156394/CVE/anydesk.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/eb9d5949573bf98755141185e45226827196e91c/vulndb/vulns/nist/2026/07/VW-2026-22268.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-15681.json","https://github.com/LeSuisse/nixpkgs-security-advisory-osv/blob/723cc8b27c32d0b04c91d92b588359c853c89df5/advisories/2026/NIXPKGS-2026-2167.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0494.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0492","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0492.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-15680","title":"Lorex 2K Indoor Wi-Fi Security Camera 格式字符串远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Lorex 2K Indoor Wi-Fi Security Camera 的 sonia 二进制程序在解析 JSON 请求时存在格式化字符串漏洞，由于未对用户提供的字符串进行有效验证便直接用作格式化字符串参数，导致远程代码执行。网络相邻且未经验证的攻击者可利用该漏洞以 root 权限执行任意代码，完全控制受影响设备。该漏洞影响 Lorex 2K Indoor Wi-Fi Security Camera 系列产品，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-15680"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-07-13T22:16:45Z","updated":"2026-07-14T16:45:45Z","remediation":"立即联系 Lorex 技术支持确认是否有针对 sonia 二进制格式串漏洞的固件更新，并将摄像头固件升级至最新版本。如暂无补丁，在防火墙上设置 ACL 规则，仅允许受信任的管理设备访问摄像头 IP 的 Web 管理端口，禁止来自非信任网段的连接。同时将摄像头部署在独立 VLAN 中，与核心业务网络隔离，限制网络邻接攻击者的可达路径。若短期内无法升级，建议在摄像头 Web 管理界面中禁用不必要的 JSON API 功能（如设备发现、远程配置接口），并修改默认管理员密码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-26-398/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2026/15xxx/CVE-2026-15680.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/e6fb55bfbbe31c8b8776d60f6e3b3154ee0fa3bf/reports/2026-07-13/TIER_2_CVE-2026-15680.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2026/15xxx/CVE-2026-15680.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2026-15680.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-15680.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-j88j-q5w5-7q9p/GHSA-j88j-q5w5-7q9p.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db2f5eda64b048f89c93b57f05c779b62a05c5c9/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-15680.json","https://github.com/wooluo/vuln_crawler/blob/32f2293479ff686679659fbb5e0a89dfb65ba641/vulnerability_reports/vulnerability_report_2026-07-16_11-05-13.md","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/eb9d5949573bf98755141185e45226827196e91c/vulndb/vulns/nist/2026/07/VW-2026-22267.yaml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/a7af5a678b55af1e4884963bdb9ea6fae03d5b34/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-156xx/CVE-2026-15680.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0492.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0742","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0742.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55771","title":"Cedar-Java 实体标识符相等性比较错误漏洞","description":"Cedar-Java 是开源 Java 实现的 Cedar 策略语言，用于细粒度授权决策。其 EntityIdentifier.equals() 方法存在空引用与自身引用判断逻辑反转的漏洞，导致比较 null 时意外返回 true，比较自身时反而返回 false。该漏洞虽然不影响 Cedar 本身通过 Rust 实现的授权决策计算，但会影响直接调用该方法进行实体标识符相等性比较的集成方，可能导致策略执行出现错误判断。该漏洞影响所有 4.9.0 之前的 Cedar-Java 版本，攻击者需具备一定权限访问使用该库的应用程序方可触发。已在版本 4.9.0 中修复此问题，建议立即升级至最新版本，同时 fork 或衍生的代码也应同步合并修复补丁，对安全敏感的相等性比较可临时采用其他校验方式作为缓解措施。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55771","GHSA-4r9r-4425-74p7"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-13T20:16:48Z","updated":"2026-07-14T15:17:04Z","remediation":"立即将 CedarJava 升级到 4.9.0 或更高版本，并检查所有 fork 或衍生代码，确保包含新的修复补丁。在升级完成前，避免在安全敏感场景中使用 EntityIdentifier.equals() 方法进行相等性比较，改用其他可靠的比较逻辑作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/cedar-policy/cedar-java/security/advisories/GHSA-4r9r-4425-74p7","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0235c22e9b6c7ddb8ada469b545320bce3ffcbfa/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55771.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bc943eb819a406135c2391ed30d595e2ea60281b/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55771.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-55771.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-55771.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-55771.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/77c1c4e2b164ba912ebd6005200ea105caf493c9/reports/2026-07-13/TIER_3_CVE-2026-55771.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b5070d3c2d6dc2fda079c163276abcda1c82b124/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-557xx/CVE-2026-55771.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/c40d15bc736663c338800597e967d5eaca965fc9/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-55771/README.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/maven/com.cedarpolicy/cedar-java/CVE-2026-55771.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/61334472876cf5ad32f3637a7727b548d9acebb5/content/posts/cve-2026-55771.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0742.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0490","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0490.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-15551","title":"Samsung rlottie 整数回绕堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Samsung 开源 rlottie 库存在整数溢出或回绕漏洞（CWE-190），在处理特制矢量动画文件时，由于整数运算未正确校验边界，导致堆缓冲区溢出。本地攻击者需诱使用户打开恶意构造的动画文件，利用此漏洞可造成目标应用崩溃（可用性影响为高），或可能泄露少量敏感信息（机密性和完整性影响为低）。该漏洞影响 Samsung rlottie 的所有受影响版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-15551"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-07-13T01:17:05Z","updated":"2026-07-13T19:28:17Z","remediation":"建议从 Samsung/rlottie GitHub 仓库 master 分支拉取包含 PR #595 修复的最新代码（提交 f487eff2f8086b84ae1c7faa0418abec909e874b，合并于 2026-07-03），重新编译安装 rlottie 库。该修复将 SW_FT_Span.y 坐标的 INT_MAX 限幅改为 short 类型安全上限，防止 16 位截断导致的堆缓冲区溢出。若暂无法升级，建议在应用层限制 Lottie 动画文件的输入来源，仅加载受信任的动画资源，避免解析恶意构造的 Lottie 文件触发整数溢出。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Samsung/rlottie/pull/595","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2026/15xxx/CVE-2026-15551.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b7d9f3f65d1036a114c9bae4a66ed35d83999166/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-15551.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-15551","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2026/15xxx/CVE-2026-15551.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2026-15551.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-15551.md","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/9c64290b74a702cc2cb0f57d040036009e789093/rlottie/TODO","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db2f5eda64b048f89c93b57f05c779b62a05c5c9/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-15551.json","https://github.com/jgamblin/cvelint-action/blob/9a8a5da65a1458854219fa63b08ed65dbe98d334/CNAReports/samsung.tv_appliance.csv","https://github.com/Huangu0/sec_rss_news/blob/c46faafa70787fe2612f0051de58d5a05bef4d0b/output/weekly/2026-07-13.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0490.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0278","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0278.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-45376","title":"Decidim 管理后台用户搜索 SQL 注入漏洞","description":"Decidim 是一套公民参与平台框架。其管理后台用户搜索端点 GET /admin/organization/users 使用来自 params[:term] 的不可信输入构造 SQL ORDER BY 表达式，且字符串插值发生在 ActiveRecord 消毒处理之前。攻击者需持有管理员会话，通过构造特殊搜索字符串可向 PostgreSQL 注入任意 SQL，利用时序差异进行盲注，读取数据库角色权限范围内的其他表数据或造成拒绝服务。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-45376","GHSA-jvqq-cvh4-xm37"],"sources":["cve","github"],"published":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 decidim-admin 至 0.30.9、0.31.5 或 0.32.0 版本。如暂无法升级，应严格审查并限制具有后台访问权限的管理员账户，仅授权可信人员，以降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T16:59:49Z","references":["https://github.com/decidim/decidim/security/advisories/GHSA-jvqq-cvh4-xm37","https://github.com/decidim/decidim/pull/16668"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0278.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0277","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0277.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-45330","title":"Decidim 验证管理员跨组织越权访问身份信息漏洞","description":"Decidim 参与式民主平台的身份验证管理功能存在越权访问漏洞。验证管理员控制器在加载待审核授权记录时使用 Authorization.find() 进行原始查询，未检查该记录是否属于当前组织（current_organization），导致拥有验证管理员权限的攻击者可跨组织访问、批准或拒绝其他租户的身份文档验证请求，造成敏感身份信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-45330","GHSA-86fh-w43w-338c"],"sources":["ghsa","cve"],"published":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Decidim 至 v0.32.0（或 v0.31.5、v0.30.9）及以上版本，该修复在 PR #16666 中合入，在验证管理员控制器中增加了 current_organization 归属检查。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用身份文档验证方式作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/decidim/decidim/security/advisories/GHSA-86fh-w43w-338c","https://github.com/decidim/decidim/pull/16666","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-86fh-w43w-338c/GHSA-86fh-w43w-338c.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0277.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0277.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0273","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0273.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-45086","title":"Decidim 人口统计问卷管理编辑器授权缺失漏洞","description":"Decidim 平台的人口统计问卷管理编辑器存在授权缺失漏洞。/admin/demographics/questions 路由未对调用者进行管理员权限校验，已登录的普通参与者可直接访问管理界面并修改问卷内容。攻击者只需拥有普通用户账号即可利用此漏洞，无需管理员权限，可导致问卷数据被未授权篡改，影响平台数据完整性与管理安全。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-45086","GHSA-vq6j-hj8w-7v39"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级至 Decidim 0.32.0 或 0.31.5 及以上版本，这两个版本已在 PR #16665 中修复 /admin/demographics/questions 路由缺少管理员权限校验的问题。如无法立即升级，可禁用 decidim-demographics 模块，或在 Nginx 反向代理层限制该路径的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T16:14:59Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0273.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0273.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0273.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0187","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0187.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"Oracle Unified Directory 未授权访问漏洞","description":"Oracle Unified Directory 存在权限许可和访问控制漏洞，未经认证的远程攻击者可通过 LDAP 或 RMI 接口向目标系统发送特制请求，绕过身份验证机制实现对目录服务的未授权访问。成功利用该漏洞可导致敏感目录信息泄露、权限提升甚至横向移动，威胁系统安全。该漏洞影响 Oracle Unified Directory 多个受支持版本，建议用户及时关注 Oracle 官方安全公告并安装相应补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2026-0337db81"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即通过 My Oracle Support 下载并安装适用于当前 Oracle Unified Directory 版本的最新 Critical Patch Update（CPU）补丁并完成重启验证；在补丁落地前，于网络边界与主机防火墙严格限制 LDAP（389/636）及 RMI 管理端口仅对可信管理网段开放，关闭或限制匿名绑定与未鉴权 RMI 访问，并定期审计目录访问与认证日志。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpujan2026.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0187.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0009","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0009.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"Universal 1337 Stealer 窃密恶意软件文件检测规则","description":"Universal 1337 Stealer 是一款针对 FTP 凭据和系统敏感信息进行窃取的 Stealer 类恶意软件。该恶意软件通过二进制特征标记（如 [SPLIT]、[HERE]、FTP~ 等特定字符串模式）在文件中留下痕迹。Nuclei 模板通过匹配文件中的二进制特征码（包括 2A5B532D502D4C2D492D545D2A、4654507E 等十六进制模式）来检测该恶意软件。感染后攻击者可窃取 FTP 客户端账号密码、系统配置等敏感数据，影响系统机密性与数据安全。传播途径主要包括钓鱼邮件附件和恶意捆绑下载。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["NUCLEI-FILE-MALWARE-UNIVERSAL-1337-MALWARE-YAML"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议使用杀毒软件（如 ClamAV、Microsoft Defender、卡巴斯基等）对系统进行全盘扫描以检测并清除 Universal 1337 Stealer 恶意软件。及时更新病毒库至最新版本。修改可能已被窃取的所有 FTP 账号密码及其他敏感凭证。排查系统异常进程和启动项，删除检出恶意文件后重启系统，勿打开来源不明的邮件附件或点击可疑链接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T12:10:58Z","references":["https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/file/malware/universal-1337-malware.yaml","https://github.com/Yara-Rules/rules/blob/master/malware/MALW_Stealer.yar"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0009.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0113","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0113.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59260","title":"OpenWrt luci-app-samba4 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"OpenWrt luci-app-samba4 存在 ACL 权限配置不当漏洞，其 read ACL 不当授予了 /usr/sbin/smbd 的 file.exec 权限，导致经过身份验证的委派用户能够以调用者控制的命令行参数执行 Samba 守护进程。攻击者可向 root 权限的 smbd 进程传递 message command 等任意 Samba 全局选项，当 SMB 协议消息被处理时触发命令执行。该漏洞影响运行 OpenWrt 并启用 luci-app-samba4 组件的设备，CVSS 评分 8.7，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59260"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-12T12:16:45Z","updated":"2026-07-13T20:03:31Z","remediation":"立即升级 OpenWrt 至修复该漏洞的版本（关注官方安全公告中 luci-app-samba4 的补丁更新）。临时缓解措施：移除 /usr/sbin/smbd 文件上多余的 file.exec ACL 权限（执行 `setfacl -x u:anyuser:exec /usr/sbin/smbd`）；在 luci-app-samba4 配置中禁用未使用的 Samba 全局选项传递功能；在防火墙层面限制 SMB 端口（139,445）仅允许受信任的内网 IP 访问；审查并收紧 luci-app-samba4 的 ACL 配置，确保 smbd 可执行文件仅对 root 具有执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/openwrt/luci/security/advisories/GHSA-vx64-mmp7-h36c","https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/openwrt-luci-app-samba4-read-acl-remote-code-execution-via-smbd","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2026/CVE-2026-59260.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59260.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-07-12/TIER_2_CVE-2026-59260.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3a91743cb361cea8aa97e228bbbca0ca0cb04482/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59260.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2026/CVE-2026-59260/README.md","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/b7272967d4cf0923f79d101c86e7ecac005fe400/doc/2026-07/%E7%B4%A7%E6%80%A5%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E9%A2%84%E8%AD%A6%EF%BD%9COpenWrt%20Samba%E8%A2%AB%E6%9B%9D%E9%AB%98%E5%8D%B1%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2026-59260)%EF%BC%8C%E6%94%BB%E5%87%BB%E8%80%85%E5%8F%AF%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96Root%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-59260.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59260.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e52c2c075f8ae41771cb3f6120956c7f745eea35/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-7pqv-wj3v-fcq3/GHSA-7pqv-wj3v-fcq3.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb5b1eedc994a703f39cb712ed03e138958e291d/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59260.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-59260"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0113.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0110","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0110.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-56259","title":"Crawl4AI Docker API 凭据泄露漏洞","description":"Crawl4AI Docker API 服务器存在凭据泄露漏洞（CWE-200），影响 0.8.8 之前版本。攻击者无需认证即可访问 /md、/llm、/llm/job 等接口，通过构造恶意的 base_url 参数将 LLM API 调用重定向至攻击者控制的端点，并设置 api_token 为 env:VARIABLE_NAME 格式读取任意环境变量，从而窃取 JWT 签名密钥、Provider API Key、Redis 密码等敏感凭据。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高，可能导致服务器被完全接管。官方已在 0.8.8 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-56259"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-12T12:16:45Z","updated":"2026-07-14T18:29:21Z","remediation":"立即升级 Crawl4AI 至 0.8.8 或更高版本（修补提交 aa81e8f），该版本已修复 base_url 参数重定向问题并增强 LLMConfig 环境变量解析保护。如无法升级，设置 CRAWL4AI_API_TOKEN 环境变量启用 JWT 认证，并在防火墙/反向代理层限制 Docker API 端口（默认 8080/11234）仅允许受信任来源访问；升级后立即轮换所有已泄露的 Provider API Key、JWT_SECRET_KEY 及 REDIS_PASSWORD 等敏感凭据。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/unclecode/crawl4ai/security/advisories/GHSA-f989-c77f-r2cq","https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/crawl4ai-llm-credential-exfiltration-via-base-url-and-environment-variable-resolution","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/367702ad7530a5ba67c1bf5ac2a64f2d7987df9f/data/vuln/crawl4ai/CVE-2026-56259.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/01aff5db145d29bbcb0b8fff3fe830e13aa53d69/cves/2026/56xxx/CVE-2026-56259.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/fdf19595af0ac0832011c9bde3da2f545d136f2f/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-56259.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-07-12/TIER_2_CVE-2026-56259.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3a91743cb361cea8aa97e228bbbca0ca0cb04482/2026/56xxx/CVE-2026-56259.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2026/CVE-2026-56259/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-56259.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-56259.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/Crawl4AI_Docker_API_%E5%AF%86%E9%92%A5%E6%B3%84%E9%9C%B2%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-56259.toml","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/30850bb53811ed82eaed94570f6e3c90461f27d7/vulns/crawl4ai/PYSEC-2026-3448.yaml","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-56259"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0110.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0110.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0110.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0109","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0109.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-56238","title":"Capgo PostgREST 全局统计端点信息泄露漏洞","description":"Capgo 的 Supabase PostgREST 全局统计端点存在信息泄露漏洞，未认证的远程攻击者可利用公开的 apikey 直接访问 /rest/v1/global_stats 接口，无需任何额外身份验证即可获取 MRR、总收入、套餐收入细分、客户数量及运营遥测等敏感财务与业务指标数据。该漏洞影响 Capgo 12.128.2 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 8.7，危害等级高危。厂商已发布 12.128.2 版本修复此漏洞，建议在升级前通过反向代理或 WAF 限制对该端点的外部访问。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-56238"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级到 Capgo 12.128.2 或更高版本；在升级前，通过反向代理/WAF 限制对 /rest/v1/global_stats 端点的外部访问，仅允许受信 IP 或内网访问；禁用不必要公开的 PostgREST 端点并轮换当前泄露的 public apikey。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Cap-go/capgo/security/advisories/GHSA-73rv-fpp7-r3r4","https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/capgo-unauthenticated-information-disclosure-via-postgrest-global-stats-endpoint","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-56238"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0109.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0005","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0005.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"CNNVD 未分类漏洞 2026-10197788","description":"CNNVD-2026-10197788 是 CNNVD 在 2026 年收录的一则安全漏洞。目前该漏洞的详细技术细节尚未公开披露，CNNVD 官方尚未发布完整的漏洞描述信息。建议用户持续关注 CNNVD 官方网站获取最新公告，以便及时采取相应的安全防护措施。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CNNVD-2026-10197788"],"sources":["cnnvd"],"published":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","remediation":"密切关注 CNNVD 官方网站关于此漏洞的后续公告。一旦厂商发布安全更新或补丁，请立即评估影响范围并部署修复。同时建议加强网络边界防护和访问控制策略。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-12T22:43:48Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0005.toml"}]